{"4001120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Glitch prison Together", "steam_appid": 4001120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That slightly unpopular game is back online!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been imprisoned in this prison for a long time as a prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after discovering bugs existing in the world, you conducted various tests and concluded you could use them to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to break out with your reliable comrades!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a recommended 4-player escape adventure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We don't know the maximum number of players, but theoretically it's 99.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to verify various bugs within the confines of the prison and during your escape, aiming for the fastest breakout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate physically interactive objects, transparent walls, and odd behaviors to achieve the fastest escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom game mode called BATTLE MODE is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Battle Mode, the first player to reach the goal wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're comfortable with the game, try racing against friends for the fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 hours to 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no specific restrictions on video streaming.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That slightly unpopular game is back online!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been imprisoned in this prison for a long time as a prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after discovering bugs existing in the world, you conducted various tests and concluded you could use them to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to break out with your reliable comrades!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a recommended 4-player escape adventure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We don't know the maximum number of players, but theoretically it's 99.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to verify various bugs within the confines of the prison and during your escape, aiming for the fastest breakout. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate physically interactive objects, transparent walls, and odd behaviors to achieve the fastest escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom game mode called BATTLE MODE is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Battle Mode, the first player to reach the goal wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're comfortable with the game, try racing against friends for the fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 hours to 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no specific restrictions on video streaming.</p>", "short_description": "Find bugs with your friends, exploit them, and escape!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001120/597436b8ac564d461978bea0f56f007066adbd81/header.jpg?t=1773628855", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.